<title>USA: Mesa Laboratories Inc Q4 net increases.</title>
<headline>Mesa Laboratories Inc Q4 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, Colo. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended:	   3/31/97			3/31/96</p>
<p> Net Sales		     $2,020,000		  $2,394,000</p>
<p> Net Income			 532,000		     489,000</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share		   .12			   .11</p>
<p> Average Shares		 4,431,000		   4,352,000</p>
<p> Twelve Months Ended:	  3/31/97			3/31/96</p>
<p> Net Sales			7,774,000		   8,063,000</p>
<p> Net Income		     1,720,000		   1,624,000</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share		   .39			   .37</p>
<p> Average Shares		 4,466,000		   4,366,000</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
